# Day and night (CR 731, 502.2). Bot1's Outland Liberator on turn 1 makes it day (CR 702.145d). Bot2 casts nothing on
# turn 2, so the untap step of turn 3 turns it night and the Liberator over into Frenzied Trapbreaker. Bot1 casts two
# Moxen on turn 3, so the untap step of turn 4 makes it day again (a player who casts two or more spells in their own turn)
# and the Trapbreaker is the Liberator again. Bot2 casts nothing on turn 4 either, so turn 5 is night once more, and the
# second Liberator Bot1 casts then enters transformed (CR 702.145b), a 3/3 Nightbound that no effect could turn back.

